# Greenline Charts — conventions

Follow `docs/COOKBOOK.md` in full. Summary for every change:

## FSD

- Layers: app → pages → widgets → features → entities → shared. Import only downward.
- No cross-imports between slices on the same layer. Export slices only via root `index.ts`.
- Slice folders: `ui/`, `model/`, `api/` as needed.

## Vue SFC block order

1. `template`
2. `script setup lang="ts"`
3. `style scoped`

## Styles

- Global tokens/reset: `@shared/styles`. Use CSS variables in components.
- Reusable layout/UI → `@shared/ui`. No duplicate layout CSS across pages.
- PrimeVue theme only in `@app/providers`; import Prime components individually.

## Components

- `shared/ui`: presentational, props/emits/slots only, no API calls.
- pages/widgets/features/entities: smart composition and domain logic.
- `defineOptions({ name })` matches file name. Typed props/emits. No `any`.
- DRY: extract composables and shared UI before copying code.

## Aliases

Use `@app`, `@pages`, `@widgets`, `@features`, `@entities`, `@shared` — not deep relative paths across layers.
